; A realistic month of activity in beancount syntax: opening balances, a
; few paychecks, recurring expenses, and a savings transfer. Exercises
; date ordering, multiple narrations, and balance accumulation.

2024-01-01 open Assets:US:BofA:Checking USD
2024-01-01 open Assets:US:BofA:Savings USD
2024-01-01 open Income:Salary USD
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Rent USD
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Groceries USD
2024-01-01 open Equity:Opening USD

2024-01-01 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking          1500.00 USD
  Equity:Opening                  -1500.00 USD

2024-01-15 * "Acme Corp" "Mid-month payroll"
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking          2500.00 USD
  Income:Salary                   -2500.00 USD

2024-01-20 * "Riverside Apartments" "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent                    1800.00 USD
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking         -1800.00 USD

2024-01-25 * "Trader Joe's" "Weekly groceries"
  Expenses:Groceries                124.36 USD
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking          -124.36 USD

2024-01-31 * "Transfer to savings"
  Assets:US:BofA:Savings            500.00 USD
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking          -500.00 USD
